  "_comment": "Shared fixtures for the voice parser (Sprint 16). The JS parser (static/js/voiceparse.js) and the Python parser (voiceparse.py) are both tested against this one file so they cannot drift. Each case: say = what the user said; want = the fields the parser must produce (null = not set, parser guesses/leaves blank). amount is a positive number; direction is expense|income; channel is a short label or null. 'try' marks phrases good to demo by voice. 'multi' expects several items.",
